alue":"Library-managed. Do not specify explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"triggerdebouncems","children":[{"type":"text","value":"triggerDebounceMs?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional triggerDebounceMs?: \n  | number\n| ListenerDebounceFn<TFormData, TValue>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L173","children":[{"type":"text","value":"listeners.public.ts:173"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The debounce delay in milliseconds before the listener runs."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A function recalculates the delay for each matching event. Repeated events\nrestart the delay, and the listener receives the latest event context.\nValues less than or equal to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"0"},{"type":"text","value":" run immediately. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'submit'"},{"type":"text","value":" events always\nrun immediately."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"default","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Default"}]},{"type":"code","value":"0","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"triggers","children":[{"type":"text","value":"triggers"}]},{"type":"code","value":"triggers: ListenerTriggerOption<TTriggers, TFormData, TValue>[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L191","children":[{"type":"text","value":"listeners.public.ts:191"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The events that can invoke the listener."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The listener runs at most once for an event, even if multiple entries\nmatch. An empty array disables the listener."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"triggers: [\n  'blur',\n  {\n    trigger: 'change',\n    when: ({ formApi }) => formApi.state.isDirty,\n  },\n],","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"extended-by","text":"Extended by","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"ttriggers","text":"TTriggers","level":3},{"id":"tformdata","text":"TFormData","level":3},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"triggerdebouncems","text":"triggerDebounceMs?","level":3},{"id":"default","text":"Default","level":4},{"id":"triggers","text":"triggers","level":3},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:158](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L158)\n\nConfiguration shared by form and field listeners.\n\n## Extended by\n\n- [`FormListener`](FormListener.md)\n- [`FieldListener`](FieldListener.md)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TTriggers\n\n`TTriggers` *extends* [`FieldListenerTriggers`](../type-aliases/FieldListenerTriggers.md)\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Properties\n\n### triggerDebounceMs?\n\n```ts\noptional triggerDebounceMs?: \n  | number\n| ListenerDebounceFn<TFormData, TValue>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:173](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L173)\n\nThe debounce delay in milliseconds before the listener runs.\n\nA function recalculates the delay for each matching event. Repeated events\nrestart the delay, and the listener receives the latest event context.\nValues less than or equal to `0` run immediately. `'submit'` events always\nrun immediately.\n\n#### Default\n\n```ts\n0\n```\n\n***\n\n### triggers\n\n```ts\ntriggers: ListenerTriggerOption<TTriggers, TFormData, TValue>[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:191](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L191)\n\nThe events that can invoke the listener.\n\nThe listener runs at most once for an event, even if multiple entries\nmatch. An empty array disables the listener.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\ntriggers: [\n  'blur',\n  {\n    trigger: 'change',\n    when: ({ formApi }) => formApi.state.isDirty,\n  },\n],\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: Listener\ntitle: Listener\n---\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:158](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L158)\n\nConfiguration shared by form and field listeners.\n\n## Extended by\n\n- [`FormListener`](FormListener.md)\n- [`FieldListener`](FieldListener.md)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TTriggers\n\n`TTriggers` *extends* [`FieldListenerTriggers`](../type-aliases/FieldListenerTriggers.md)\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Properties\n\n### triggerDebounceMs?\n\n```ts\noptional triggerDebounceMs?: \n  | number\n| ListenerDebounceFn<TFormData, TValue>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:173](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L173)\n\nThe debounce delay in milliseconds before the listener runs.\n\nA function recalculates the delay for each matching event. Repeated events\nrestart the delay, and the listener receives the latest event context.\nValues less than or equal to `0` run immediately. `'submit'` events always\nrun immediately.\n\n#### Default\n\n```ts\n0\n```\n\n***\n\n### triggers\n\n```ts\ntriggers: ListenerTriggerOption<TTriggers, TFormData, TValue>[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [listeners.public.ts:191](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/listeners.public.ts#L191)\n\nThe events that can invoke the listener.\n\nThe listener runs at most once for an event, even if multiple entries\nmatch. An empty array disables the listener.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\ntriggers: [\n  'blur',\n  {\n    trigger: 'change',\n    when: ({ formApi }) => formApi.state.isDirty,\n  },\n],\n```\n"}
